answers.approach:
Hush—no wiser prompt can make the danger small;
Send every tool-bound action through a policy wall.
Give each agent its own name, brief scope, and bounded purse;
Keep signed, unbroken receipts, for better or for worse.
First shadow, then a canary, let small changes fly;
Let no fetched text grant power; keep breakers standing by.
What can’t be unsent needs staging and a watcher’s care;
We’ll test and share where safeguards fail—the answer isn’t there.
